90</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10667592</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b18-cin-07-41"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Trenz</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Rothfuss</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Schutz</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Speit</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mutagen sensitivity of peripheral blood from women carrying a BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutation</article-title><source>Mutat Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>500</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>2</lpage><fpage>89</fpage><lpage>96</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11890929</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b19-cin-07-41"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gasser</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Raulet</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The DNA damage response, immunity and cancer</article-title><source>Semin Cancer Biol</source><year>2006</year><volume>16</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>344</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16914325</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b20-cin-07-41"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sharma</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Sahni</surname><given-names>NS</given-names></name><name><surname>Tibshirani</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Early detection of breast cancer based on gene-expression patterns in peripheral blood cells</article-title><source>Breast Cancer Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>7</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>R634</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16168108</pub-id></mixed-citation></r