41"><label>24</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Andrews</surname><given-names>HN</given-names></name><name><surname>Mullan</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></name><name><surname>McWilliams</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>BRCA1 regulates the interferon gamma-mediated apoptotic response</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2002</year><volume>277</volume><issue>29</issue><fpage>26225</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12011077</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b25-cin-07-41"><label>25</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Takimoto</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>MacLachlan</surname><given-names>TK</given-names></name><name><surname>Dicker</surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name><name><surname>Niitsu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>e-Deiry</surname><given-names>WS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>BRCA1 transcriptionally regulates damaged DNA binding protein (DDB2) in the DNA repair response following UV-irradiation</article-title><source>Cancer Biol Ther</source><year>2002</year><volume>1</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>177</fpage><lpage>86</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12170778</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b26-cin-07-41"><label>26</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Castle</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Garret-Engele</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Armour</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Optimization of oligonucleotide arrays and RNA amplification protocols for analysis of transcript structure and alternative splicing</arti