</italic> mutation carriers.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CIN-07-41-g003"/></fig><fig id="f4-cin-07-41" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Distribution of log ratios between 15 <italic>BRCA1</italic> mutation carriers and 15 non-carriers for VAV3 and <italic>BRCA1</italic> transcripts. Dashed lines represent mean log ratios in each group (mutation carriers and non-carriers) (<bold>A</bold>) Distribution of log ratios for VAV3 transcript, an oncogene found to be differentially expressed between mutation carriers and non-carriers after a t-test with a p-value &#x0003c; 0.01 performed on 16,997 genes. (<bold>B</bold>) Distribution of median log ratios for the ten <italic>BRCA1</italic> replicates.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="CIN-07-41-g004"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-cin-07-41" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Sample characteristics for <italic>BRCA1</italic> mutation carriers and non-carriers.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Sample</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Family number</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Sex</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Diagnosis (Age)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Familial <italic>BRCA1</italic> mutation</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Carrier Yes/No</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mutation type</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Exon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">R282</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0017&#x02013;01</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">F</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">74</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Breast cancer (54)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">c. 3841_3843delCA</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Yes</td><td align="center" rowspan="1"